.SS "\fBschultz_handle\fP schultz_handle_make (uint32_t index, uint32_t generation)"

.PP
Packs an index and generation into a handle\&. Exposed for tests and debug tooling\&. Ordinary code receives handles from schultz_handle_table_insert instead\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIindex\fP Slot index, in the low 32 bits of the result\&. 
.br
\fIgeneration\fP Generation counter, in the high 32 bits of the result\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The packed handle\&. Note that a generation of zero produces a handle that can never be valid\&. 
.RE
.PP

